# 🤖 AI Market Research Agent

An AI-powered market research automation built with n8n.

This workflow allows users to submit a business category, search query, location, city, and preferred language through a form. The automation then collects business information, analyzes the available data, generates a professional market research report, and sends the final report via email.

## 🚀 Features

- 📝 Collects research requirements through a form
- 🔎 Searches for relevant businesses
- 📍 Supports location and city-based research
- ⭐ Collects ratings and review information
- 🌐 Collects website and business information
- 🤖 Uses AI for market analysis
- 📊 Performs competitor analysis
- 💡 Identifies market opportunities and gaps
- 📑 Generates a structured research report
- 📧 Automatically sends the report by email
- 🌍 Supports Bangla and English output

## 🔄 Workflow

Form Submission
↓
Business Search
↓
Data Collection
↓
Data Processing
↓
Data Aggregation
↓
AI Market Analysis
↓
Report Generation
↓
Email Delivery

## 🛠️ Technologies

- n8n
- AI / LLM
- Google Maps / SerpApi
- Gmail
- JavaScript
- Webhooks / Forms

## 📋 User Inputs

The user can provide:

- Search Query
- Business Category
- Location / Country
- City
- Preferred Language

## 📊 Generated Report

The AI-generated report can include:

- Research Summary
- Business Information
- Competitor Analysis
- Rating & Review Analysis
- Strengths & Weaknesses
- Market Gaps
- Market Opportunities
- Actionable Recommendations
- Final Conclusion

## 🎯 Purpose

The main goal of this project is to automate repetitive market research tasks and turn raw business data into a useful, structured report.

This project was created as part of my journey in learning and building real-world AI automation systems.

## ⚠️ Note

The accuracy of the final report depends on the quality and accuracy of the data returned by the connected search and business-data services.

## 👨‍💻 Built With

Built with n8n, JavaScript, AI, business search APIs, and Gmail automation.
